    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks that helps. i'm trying to dig a bit deeper into the opposition side though. i've seen some people online saying that the arguments against mandates are basically just conspiracy theories or people being \"anti-science.\" is that a fair way to characterize those concerns, or are there more substantive arguments that people usually point to?",
